QUESTION
Which papers satisfy these requirements: the abstract explicitly includes at least one of “we derive an exact expression” or “we derive analytical expressions” (case-insensitive); and at least one author is affiliated with Sloan Fellows; and the recorded paper rank is at most 20531, and the recorded normalized venue namespace is journal?

